| Level | Continuous (MLR) | Ordered (WLSMV/Theta) |
|---|---|---|
| Configural | free | free |
| Weak | loadings | loadings |
| Strong | loadings + intercepts | loadings + thresholds |
| Strict | + residuals | + residuals |
